<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">文档接龙</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">发起一个接龙收集 .docx：同学从聊天卡片进入同一接龙提交文档，任何人可一键审核格式。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-head">
      <text class="section-title">发起接龙</text>
      <view class="toggle" bindtap="onToggleCreate">{{createOpen ? '收起' : '＋ 填写'}}</view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{createOpen}}">
      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-label">接龙标题 <text class="required">*</text></view>
        <input
          class="input"
          value="{{form.title}}"
          data-field="title"
          bindinput="onFormInput"
          maxlength="40"
          placeholder="例如：2026 届毕业论文第一批"
          placeholder-class="input-placeholder"
        />
        <view class="field-tip">{{form.title.length}}/40</view>
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-label">发起人昵称 <text class="required">*</text></view>
        <input
          class="input"
          value="{{form.owner}}"
          data-field="owner"
          bindinput="onFormInput"
          maxlength="20"
          placeholder="第一次使用会提示填写，只保存在本机"
          placeholder-class="input-placeholder"
        />
        <view class="field-tip">当前昵称：{{nickname || '未设置'}}</view>
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-label">检查规范 <text class="required">*</text></view>
        <picker
          mode="selector"
          range="{{profileLabels}}"
          value="{{profileIndex}}"
          bindchange="onProfileChange"
          disabled="{{profileLabels.length === 0}}"
        >
          <view class="picker-value {{selectedProfileLabel ? '' : 'is-placeholder'}}">{{selectedProfileLabel || '正在加载规范…'}}</view>
        </picker>
        <view class="field-tip">规范列表来自后端 /api/profiles；没有想要的就先用默认规范。</view>
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-label">说明（可选）</view>
        <textarea
          class="textarea"
          value="{{form.note}}"
          data-field="note"
          bindinput="onFormInput"
          maxlength="200"
          auto-height
          placeholder="例如：请提交终稿，文件名写「学号+姓名」"
          placeholder-class="input-placeholder"
        />
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field-label">截止日期（可选）</view>
        <view class="due-row">
          <picker class="due-picker" mode="date" value="{{form.due}}" start="{{dueToday}}" bindchange="onDueChange">
            <view class="picker-value {{form.due ? '' : 'is-placeholder'}}">{{form.due || '不限截止时间'}}</view>
          </picker>
          <view wx:if="{{form.due}}" class="link due-clear" bindtap="onClearDue">清除</view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <button
        class="btn btn-primary btn-block {{creating ? 'btn-loading' : ''}}"
        loading="{{creating}}"
        disabled="{{creating}}"
        bindtap="onCreateTap"
      >{{creating ? '创建中…' : '创建接龙'}}</button>
      <view class="form-hint">创建成功会得到 6 位接龙码；把接龙卡片分享给同学即可一起提交。</view>
    </view>

    <view wx:else class="collapse-hint">点右上「＋ 填写」发起新的接龙；也可以直接在下方选择已有接龙提交文档。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-head">
    <text class="section-title">全部接龙</text>
    <text class="section-count">{{collections.length}} 个</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state-box">
    <view class="state-title">加载中…</view>
    <view class="state-desc">正在获取接龙列表</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{errorText}}" class="card state-box">
    <view class="state-title">列表加载失败</view>
    <view class="state-desc">{{errorText}}</view>
    <view class="state-action">
      <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-mini" bindtap="onRetry">重试</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{collections.length === 0}}" class="state-box">
    <view class="state-title">还没有接龙</view>
    <view class="state-desc">点上面「＋ 填写」发起一个接龙，把卡片分享到班级群，同学就能进来提交 .docx。</view>
  </view>

  <scroll-view wx:else class="list-scroll" style="height: {{listHeight}}rpx" scroll-y>
    <view
      class="col-item"
      wx:for="{{collections}}"
      wx:key="code"
      data-code="{{item.code}}"
      bindtap="onCollectionTap"
    >
      <view class="col-head">
        <text class="col-title">{{item.title}}</text>
        <text class="code-chip">{{item.code}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="meta-row">
        <text class="muted">发起人</text>
        <text class="meta-value">{{item.owner}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="meta-row">
        <text class="muted">检查规范</text>
        <text class="meta-value">{{item.rulesetName}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="col-foot">
        <text class="count-pill">{{item.submissionText}}</text>
        <text class="due-text {{item.duePast ? 'due-past' : ''}}">{{item.dueText}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>

  <view class="footer-tip">下拉刷新列表 · 点任意接龙进入详情提交/审核</view>
  <view class="debug-row">
    <view class="debug-link" bindtap="onDiagnoseTap">网络自检 · 手机连不上后端时点这里</view>
  </view>
</view>
